Rule 12 (n and x tensors must have broadcast-compatible shapes aligned from trailing dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 0 ∨ ndim(v_2) = 0 then true else if ndim(v_1) ≤ ndim(v_2) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1 - i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1 - i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1 - i) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1 - i) else ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1 - i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1 - i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1 - i) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1 - i)
